WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.623
Local image and

00:00:01.435 --> 00:00:03.074
video generation one

00:00:02.885 --> 00:00:03.663
CLI

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:05.290
openfal is an

00:00:05.102 --> 00:00:06.151
open source server

00:00:05.963 --> 00:00:06.858
that runs Qwen

00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:08.002
Image 2.1

00:00:08.227 --> 00:00:09.854
Wan 2.2 and

00:00:09.677 --> 00:00:11.115
MiniMax H3 on

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:11.941
your own Windows

00:00:12.024 --> 00:00:13.215
Linux or Mac

00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:13.733
machine

00:00:14.254 --> 00:00:15.586
Three commands detect

00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:16.317
your GPU

00:00:16.518 --> 00:00:17.697
install the smallest

00:00:17.509 --> 00:00:18.534
image setup at

00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:19.820
about 16 gigabytes

00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:20.822
and serve an

00:00:20.704 --> 00:00:21.647
API with a

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:22.720
Studio interface

00:00:23.246 --> 00:00:24.354
It mimics fal's

00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:25.451
routes queues and

00:00:25.262 --> 00:00:26.618
Python SDK

00:00:26.748 --> 00:00:27.691
so apps built

00:00:27.503 --> 00:00:28.328
for the hosted

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:29.342
service can point

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:29.779
at your own

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.639
box instead

00:00:30.852 --> 00:00:32.255
no ComfyUI graphs

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:32.680
needed

00:00:33.198 --> 00:00:34.212
Full story on

00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:34.919
the dashboard
